    "sections": {
        "description": "Technology Software Firm Theme features a structured layout suitable for presenting digital services, software products, company information, and technical content. The theme includes responsive page sections, customizable banners, service blocks, team profiles, pricing tables, and blog layouts. It supports multiple page templates and flexible typography settings for organizing content clearly across different screen sizes. The design uses a clean interface with balanced spacing and simple navigation patterns to improve readability and accessibility. The theme also includes customization options for colors, headers, footers, and widget areas through the built-in customizer. It supports image galleries, call-to-action sections, testimonial displays, and contact form integration for communication purposes. Optimized code structure and lightweight elements help maintain stable performance and loading speed. The layout is compatible with common plugins used for SEO, caching, and multilingual functionality. Additional features such as social media integration, menu management, and responsive sliders provide flexibility for creating a modern and organized online presence."
    },
